{"id":"desyatok","lemma":"десяток","pos":"noun","rank":4462,"glosses":["ten, set of ten","tens, ten's place","decade"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/ed/Ru-%D0%B4%D0%B5%D1%81%D1%8F%D1%82%D0%BE%D0%BA.ogg/Ru-%D0%B4%D0%B5%D1%81%D1%8F%D1%82%D0%BE%D0%BA.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"десятка","plural":"десятки"},"examples":[{"text":"Ей в это время никак не мог быть третий десяток.","en":"She can't have been in her twenties at that time.","words":[{"g":"(to) her"},null,null,null,{"g":"by no means"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"third"},null],"phrases":[[1,4,"at the time"]]},{"text":"Я приходил туда десятки раз.","en":"I went there dozens of times.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to come , to arrive","l":"приходить"},{"g":"there"},null,{"g":"time"}]},{"text":"Там собрались десятки студентов.","en":"Dozens of students gathered there.","words":[{"g":"there"},{"g":"to gather","l":"собраться"},null,null]},{"text":"Десятки писем ожидают вас.","en":"Dozens of letters are awaiting you.","words":[null,null,{"g":"to expect","l":"ожидать"},{"g":"you","l":"вы"}]},{"text":"Она говорит, что не собирается заводить детей, пока не разменяет четвертый десяток.","en":"She says she has no intention of having a baby until she's in her thirties.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"to speak, to talk","l":"говорить"},{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to gather, to assemble","l":"собираться"},{"g":"to take"},{"g":"child","l":"ребёнок"},null,null,null,null,null],"phrases":[[7,9,"unless, until"]]}]}